        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rob Quist, Steve Riddle, Christian Johnson, Greg Reichenberg, Terry Robinson, Brian Schweitzer\n- Organizations: Mission Mountain Wood Band, University of Montana, Montana Arts Council\n- Places: Montana\n- Roles: singer, instrumentalist, songwriter, politician, musical and cultural ambassador\n\nFacts:\n- Rob Quist was born on January 5, 1948.\n- Rob Quist is an American singer, guitarist, banjo player, songwriter, and politician.\n- The original five members of Mission Mountain Wood Band were Rob Quist, Steve Riddle, Christian Johnson, Greg Reichenberg, and Terry Robinson.\n- The original five members of Mission Mountain Wood Band were all University of Montana students and were all born in Montana.\n- Rob Quist is known as a musical and cultural ambassador for Montana.\n- Brian Schweitzer appointed Rob Quist to the Montana Arts Council.",
